<h3 style="background:#f1f8fc;color:#123b5d;border-left:5px solid #39a9c7;border-radius:7px;padding:9px 13px;margin:20px 0 10px;font-size:clamp(18px,2.5vw,22px);line-height:1.35;">Ethics and Data Checklist</h3>
